      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Comstock’s peak activity ran from 1888 to 1910, when the Deaton Stage Line linked its depot to Ozona, about 60 mi north.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
